# Design: Freeze of the v0 portable artifact contracts

## Problem
Implementation tasks (Rust parsing, hashing, fixtures) all depend on one
stable artifact format. The format had to be frozen before any code.

## Approach
Nine JSON Schema 2020-12 files plus a README with the shared rules, the
Rust cross-field invariants, reason-code registry, and operation table.
MVP_SPEC.md controlled scope. Every schema was exercised with valid and
invalid instances, including the flagship definition.

## Key Trade-offs
- The authoring field `version` maps to the artifact field
  `schema_version`. One term serves all nine artifacts. The conversion
  is part of the tested TypeBox path.
- Profile origin gained a third value, `exact`. Exact-only definitions
  satisfy profile compatibility structurally. Their qualification can be
  `validated_for_scope` with reason `exact_rules_only`, which claims no
  measured performance.
- The input schema subset and the hashing procedure stay out of this
  freeze. They are separate contracts with their own tasks.

